[00:09.42]1. We are Jehovah’s army,
[00:15.64]Under Christ, his Son.
[00:19.76]Though we’re opposed by Satan,
[00:23.68]We are marching as one.
[00:28.12]We keep serving faithfully,
[00:32.78]Preaching far and near;
[00:37.56]We remain determined
[00:41.90]With no hint of fear.
[00:46.50](Chorus)
[00:47.14]We are Jehovah’s army;
[00:50.86]With his Christ we’re one,
[00:55.84]Joyfully declaring,
[01:00.62]“God’s rule has begun.”
[01:16.30]2. We are Jehovah’s servants,
[01:21.16]Searching for his sheep,
[01:24.94]Those who are lost and scattered,
[01:29.92]Those who sigh and who weep.
[01:33.98]These we try to find and feed
[01:38.80]With repeated calls;
[01:43.00]These we keep inviting
[01:47.54]To our Kingdom Halls.
[01:52.66](Chorus)
[01:52.66]We are Jehovah’s army;
[01:56.56]With his Christ we’re one,
[02:01.46]Joyfully declaring,
[02:05.80]“God’s rule has begun.”
[02:19.16]3. We are Jehovah’s army,
[02:24.86]Under Christ’s command,
[02:28.88]Fully equipped for battle,
[02:32.82]Each one firmly will stand.
[02:37.36]Cautious though we need to be,
[02:42.38]Upright we remain.
[02:46.48]In the face of danger,
[02:50.46]Truth we will maintain.
[02:55.94](Chorus)
[02:56.18]We are Jehovah’s army;
[02:59.94]With his Christ we’re one,
[03:04.54]Joyfully declaring,
[03:09.00]“God’s rule has begun.”
